## 3. A factory that builds `ReceiverOptions` per handler

```java
@Component
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class ReceiverOptionsFactory {

    private final KafkaProperties bootProps;   // spring.kafka.* (bootstrap servers, security, etc.)
    private final AppProperties app;

    public ResolvedConsumer resolve(TopicHandler<?> handler) {
        var override = app.consumerFor(handler.topic());

        String groupId = override != null && override.groupId() != null
                ? override.groupId() : handler.consumerGroup();

        int concurrency = override != null && override.partitionConcurrency() != null
                ? override.partitionConcurrency() : app.kafka().defaultPartitionConcurrency();

        boolean enabled = override == null || override.isEnabled();

        Map<String, Object> cfg = new HashMap<>(bootProps.buildConsumerProperties());
        cfg.putAll(handler.consumerOverrides());                       // handler-level
        if (override != null && override.properties() != null) {
            cfg.putAll(override.properties());                          // YAML-level wins
        }
        // non-negotiable settings for the reactive pipeline
        cfg.put(ConsumerConfig.GROUP_ID_CONFIG, groupId);
        cfg.put(ConsumerConfig.CLIENT_ID_CONFIG, groupId + "-" + hostName());
        cfg.put(ConsumerConfig.ENABLE_AUTO_COMMIT_CONFIG, false);
        cfg.put(ConsumerConfig.KEY_DESERIALIZER_CLASS_CONFIG, StringDeserializer.class);
        cfg.put(ConsumerConfig.VALUE_DESERIALIZER_CLASS_CONFIG, ByteArrayDeserializer.class);

        var options = ReceiverOptions.<String, byte[]>create(cfg)
                .subscription(List.of(handler.topic()))
                .commitInterval(Duration.ofSeconds(1))
                .commitBatchSize(100)
                .addAssignListener(p -> log.info("[{}] assigned {}", groupId, p))
                .addRevokeListener(p -> log.info("[{}] revoked {}", groupId, p));

        return new ResolvedConsumer(handler.topic(), groupId, concurrency, enabled, options);
    }

    public record ResolvedConsumer(String topic, String groupId, int concurrency,
                                   boolean enabled, ReceiverOptions<String, byte[]> options) {}

    private static String hostName() {
        try { return InetAddress.getLocalHost().getHostName(); } catch (Exception e) { return "unknown"; }
    }
}
```

