## 5. Per-group health indicator (so you see which business is sick)

```java
@Component
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class ConsumerStreamsHealth implements ReactiveHealthIndicator {
    private final KafkaIngestionPipeline pipeline;
    private final TopicHandlerRegistry registry;

    @Override
    public Mono<Health> health() {
        var details = new LinkedHashMap<String, Object>();
        boolean allUp = true;
        for (var h : registry.all()) {
            boolean running = pipeline.isTopicRunning(h.topic());
            details.put(h.topic(), running ? "UP" : "DOWN");
            allUp &= running;
        }
        return Mono.just((allUp ? Health.up() : Health.down()).withDetails(details).build());
    }
}
```

(`isTopicRunning` = `streams.containsKey(topic) && !streams.get(topic).isDisposed()`.)

